{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103923","id":2382944474,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OCNja","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103923","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103923.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103923.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103923","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103923/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103923/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103923/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/78221946cc826980214e241eedc2a626f9e7b463","number":103923,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add C array constructor to `Span`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Note:** Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103920.\r\nMore code to argue over :>\r\n\r\nThis will make it possible to construct `Span` implicitly from string literals and C style arrays.\r\n\r\nGiven this function:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\ntemplate <typename T>\r\nvoid function_taking_span(const Span<T> span) {\r\n    // [...]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe idea of this PR is to be able to call it with the following code\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nvoid main() {\r\n    function_taking_span(\"123\");\r\n\r\n    static int ints[] = { 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };\r\n    function_taking_span(ints);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think this is a required upgrade for developer ergonomics. But let's discuss!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c